  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GGEF invests in green infrastructure focusing on renewable energy, clean transportation and waste &amp; water management</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme in partnership with India&#x2019;s National Investment and Infrastructure Fund (NIIF) is a first of its kind climate-focused fund in the country. It invests in low-carbon and climate-resilient platforms across the energy value chain. This includes renewable energy generation, energy efficient technologies, low carbon transport and resource conservation, including water and waste management</narrative>
  </description>
